WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.100
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.100
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Episode 27

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
The Beginning of the Disaster

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:45.250
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.670
Chaos is power.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:54.710
Power comes from the heart.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:01.470
The one who masters that also controls chaos.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.350
Feel within...

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.980
The sea of chaos...

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.610
The young waters…

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:24.240
May the light that controls power shine down for eternity and protect us.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:46.930
Wait up, Froggy.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.730
There was a lightning strike.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.820
What is this?

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:08.620
It's pretty. I'll keep it as one of my treasures. It's a good luck charm.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:39.110
What's wrong, Froggy?

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:51.460
Why do you have a tail?

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.680
It's been six months, but you still don't know the cause of the phenomenon?

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:15.060
We're certain that part of Sonic's world arrived here due to Chaos Control.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.570
The people are taking this situation in stride.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:25.780
The area known as the Mystic Ruins is quickly becoming a tourist destination.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.700
The problem is the people who hate this peacefulness.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:35.830
As for Dr. Eggman's whereabouts, the intelligence agency is searching the entire world.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:40.250
Plans for a new network of surveillance satellites are also underway.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:45.550
In other words, you haven't found Eggman at all.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.590
Rouge.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.550
Whatever.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:53.730
It's not like we were playing around. Let's just admit that we lost.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:58.980
Miss Rouge, is it correct to assume that Dr. Eggman has given up on trying to conquer the world?

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.940
Not at all. It's a miracle that he's kept quiet for the past six months.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.150
A miracle?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:09.580
We promise to find and arrest him. Please give us a little more time.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.830
I'm counting on you.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.330
Yes, sir.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:17.120
By the way, how are 'they' doing?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.750
The same as ever.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:24.300
They've grown accustomed to living in our world.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.970
They're all doing fine.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:37.020
Like always, the omelet is delicately cooked.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:40.400
Thank you, Mr. Thorndyke.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:43.730
Cream, would you like another slice?

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.650
Yes! Would you like more too, Cheese?

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.330
By the way, Chris...

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:59.210
What time are you coming home from school today?

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.880
The same as always. Why?

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:09.640
Want to come to Mystic Ruins with me? I promised to test a new aircraft at Tails's workshop.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:14.310
I'm sorry, but I'm meeting Mom today. Right, Cream?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:17.520
Yes, his mother wants to show us something.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:22.270
It's been a while, so make sure she pampers you.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:26.490
I'm not a little kid anymore.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.030
Thanks, I'm done.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.820
Goodbye.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.910
Watch out for cars.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.240
I will.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:46.880
I wonder where he is right now on his journey?

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:07.610
I'm at the ocean where the battle against Eggman took place six months ago.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:12.780
The waters are blue, making it hard to imagine that a fierce battle took place here.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:18.000
No matter where I look, the scenery is always the same.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.460
I sure miss those good old days.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:35.550
Everyday was exciting, full of adventure and thrills.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:43.440
But then he suddenly disappears!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:51.530
Sonic, you idiot!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.530
Cut the noise!

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.950
Be quiet!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:06.130
I wonder if something exciting will happen again.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:18.100
Dr. Eggman created chaos throughout the world, but where did he go?

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:44.290
Turn on the E-100 Series!

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:58.350
Begin target practice!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.190
They work!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:11.860
Impressive as always, Dr. Eggman!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:16.780
The latest model of the Zero Series that have pilot parts of small animals built into them.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.450
They're finally completed.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:25.120
The word 'impossible' does not exist in my vocabulary!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:30.920
Can you see me? I'm the genius who created you, Dr. Eggman.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.550
You're all superb.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:40.600
You're the impressive first line in my E-100 Series. Listen closely to what I say from now on.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:45.730
Let's give them code names. E-101 Serial Number 1 is 'Beta.'

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:47.980
Beta.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:53.070
Serial number 2 is 'Gamma.'

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.820
Gamma.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:58.450
E-103 'Delta.'

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.030
E-104 'Epsilon.'

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:08.870
With the completion of the new robot models, it's time for you to make your appearance!

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:43.030
Based on my own excellent designs, I built this super all-purpose gigantic air combat fortress!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.040
Egg Carrier!

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:51.040
Launch!

00:10:55.710 --> 00:11:02.180
Let's go to my ideal and glorious world!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.120
Surprised?

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:31.000
Yeah, I'm surprised! This is a Chaos Emerald!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:38.840
I found it at a jewelry shop and bought it because it was beautiful. Don't you think it would look great on Cream?

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.010
What? It's for me?

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.180
It'll look cute if you wear it as an earring.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.800
It will be too heavy.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.220
Really?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:51.690
Cream, when are you going to take off that costume?

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:52.900
Huh?

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.980
Mom, Cream is…

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:03.240
Hello? Oh, right now? Okay, I understand.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:09.160
I'm sorry, but I have to get back to work. Let's reschedule dinner to some other time.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:12.500
I understand. It is what it is. Do your best!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:15.000
Chris.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.920
See you.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.250
You forgot this!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.340
Say hi to Dad too!

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:27.600
What should we do with this?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:31.850
Let's go home for now and discuss with Grandpa.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.230
Okay.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:43.700
Cheese!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:47.700
Are you okay? Is this a frog?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.620
It has a tail. How unusual.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.250
Froggy!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.670
Heavy!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:10.100
It's fleeing again.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:14.180
Froggy.

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:19.520
Are you from Sonic's world too?

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.320
What's wrong?

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:41.880
So your name is Big, and you're looking for the frog that escaped.

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:48.260
We were finally able to communicate.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.800
He's not a frog.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.640
He's Froggy.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:14:02.940
Why does Froggy keep running away? We've been friends forever.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:07.860
I'm sure we'll find him quickly if we all look for him. Don't worry.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.530
Please don't cry, Big.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.410
Thank you.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:20.250
Froggy!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.750
Froggy!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.170
Froggy!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.630
Froggy!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.350
It's become completely dark.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.270
Froggy!

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.150
Froggy?

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.490
It's not him.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:52.620
That's the same thing that Froggy swallowed.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:53.700
You know what it is?

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:57.080
When he drank it, he grew a tail.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.290
It's growing large!

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.420
No, Cheese!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.510
Who are you?

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.900
Cream, we should flee.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.360
Right.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.940
Froggy.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.830
Great! I feel great as always!

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.990
What's going on?

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.510
It's dangerous! Stay back!

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:55.720
Don't let it out of the perimeter!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.680
It's the same thing!

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.230
Move back!

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:03.350
Froggy ate it.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.950
Go ahead and shoot!

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:24.420
It's not working.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.040
It's unbelievable.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.970
Retreat!

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.860
What do you think you're doing?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.110
Sonic!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.870
Hey, how are you?

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.830
Sonic, behind you!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.630
That thing even repels bullets.

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:25.690
Whoa.

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.690
All right!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.150
Look!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:35.700
What's going on?

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.110
Are you trying to escape?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.450
Eggman!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:47.000
That's right. I'm Dr. Eggman, the greatest genius scientist in the world.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.290
Long time, no see.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:53.000
I've stayed quiet for awhile, but I'll be getting busy again.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:56.340
Are you planning to do evil things again?

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:00.850
This time, I won't let you get in my way!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.060
Cream!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.440
Chaos, catch!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:09.520
Wait!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:23.030
It's happening exactly as it said on the stone tablet.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:31.250
How's that, Sonic! For every Chaos Emerald it gets, this Chaos becomes more powerful.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.420
Chaos?

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:37.940
If I gather all seven Chaos Emeralds, it will turn into the ultimate monster.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:47.270
I'll use it to destroy Station Square and build my ideal city Eggman Land over the ruins!

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.480
Everyone, stay back.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.810
Finish them, Chaos!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.030
Hold it, Eggman!

00:18:58.570 --> 00:18:59.780
Knuckles.

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:04.200
You're the one controlling it? What did you do with the Master Emerald?

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:07.200
Did something happen to the Master Emerald?

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:12.130
What happened was- Sonic, you're here too?

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.170
Would it be better if I wasn't?

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:19.420
No, it's perfect. There are a lot of questions I have to ask him.

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:22.760
Two-on-one puts me at a disadvantage.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.310
Chaos Emerald!

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:27.390
Chaos, grow!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.730
He never gives up.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.100
It's happening again.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:37.610
Go, Chaos!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.120
Knuckles!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:01.720
Thanks!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:07.760
It changed its attack methods. That monster evolves every time it absorbs a Chaos Emerald!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.810
What in the world is it?

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:17.690
Good. Well done, Chaos!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.030
What?

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.080
Whoa!

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:31.330
Hey, hey!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.210
Now!

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:02.360
Its attack and defense power are much improved when compared to its Chaos Zero state.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.240
Make sure to finish it.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.700
You too.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.410
Take this!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.660
Not again!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:17.500
That won't be enough to stop me!

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.430
Why?

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.330
They did it!

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.710
Sonic! Knuckles!

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:07.840
How dare you!

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:12.600
Well, whatever. Chaos's power is only just beginning.

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:15.430
You're a sore loser!

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:22.270
Exactly what's going on?

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:26.650
It looks like there will be big problems again.

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:42.920
Chaos...

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.510 --> 00:25:35.360
The Mysterious Liquid Life Form, Chaos
